DTEND:20260322T205500Z
DTSTAMP:20260322T184500Z
UID:kNYK7gptoh
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 112 mins (1h52m)\n\nCommunity Screenings Screwball s
 parks fly when Cary Grant and Katharine Hepburn let loose in one of the fa
 stest and funniest films ever made—a high-wire act of invention that too
 k American screen comedy to new heights of absurdity.\n\nhttps://www.siff.
 net/programs-and-events/community-screenings/bringing-up-baby\n\nEstimated
  start: 12:00
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
